{"id":"n66213-1-8","stage":4,"title":"실크 · 丝绸","scene":"穿着与购物","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66213-1-8-1","ko":"지수야, 블라우스가 참 예쁘다.","zh":"智秀，你的衬衫真漂亮啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수야,","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；야：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"지수야","audio":"/audio/933aef68208bc459c4d9.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지수야","audio":"/audio/933aef68208bc459c4d9.mp3"}},{"text":"블라우스가","meaning":"女式衬衫（质地柔软、轻薄的上衣）","explanation":"블라우스：女式衬衫（质地柔软、轻薄的上衣）；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"블라우스","audio":"/audio/4f48bfc739a07470b4e8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71059","senseId":"1","lemma":"블라우스","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"블라우스가","audio":"/audio/94580ff42f95d5d7cc07.mp3"}},{"text":"참","meaning":"真，实在，的确","explanation":"참：真，实在，的确。","readings":[{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71761","senseId":"1","lemma":"참","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}},{"text":"예쁘다.","meaning":"漂亮，好看","explanation":"예쁘다：漂亮，好看；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"예쁘다","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89697","senseId":"1","lemma":"예쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"예쁘다","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"4f48bfc739a07470","term":"블라우스","zh":"女式衬衫（质地柔软、轻薄的上衣）","audio":"/audio/4f48bfc739a07470b4e8.mp3","entryId":"71059","definition":"手感润滑而轻柔的女式衬衫。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"8e09b5f4c09195e3","term":"참","zh":"真，实在，的确","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3","entryId":"71761","definition":"毫不违背事实或道理，真正地。","pronunciation":["참"]},{"id":"f62ff8982d788e72","term":"예쁘다","zh":"漂亮，好看","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3","entryId":"89697","definition":"长相看起来美丽，让人喜欢。","pronunciation":["예ː쁘다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f719c4d8be804ec79770.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n66213-1-8-2","ko":"고마워. 실크로 만든 거라 가격은 비싸지만 예뻐서 샀어.","zh":"谢谢。这是用丝绸做的，虽然价格有点贵，但因为它很漂亮所以就买了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"고마워.","meaning":"感谢，感激","explanation":"고맙다：感谢，感激；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"고맙다","audio":"/audio/ded2b4943e89f57dd33d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20041","senseId":"1","lemma":"고맙다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고마워","audio":"/audio/e9e8361d4662874097d3.mp3"}},{"text":"실크로","meaning":"丝绸，蚕丝","explanation":"실크：丝绸，蚕丝；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"실크","audio":"/audio/48e272a5efe4414e7afb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66213","senseId":"1","lemma":"실크","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"실크로","audio":"/audio/6aeeb53838084c492f94.mp3"}},{"text":"만든","meaning":"制作，做，制造","explanation":"만들다：制作，做，制造；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"만들다","audio":"/audio/3c159cf2a6420ca9bda5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60317","senseId":"1","lemma":"만들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"만든","audio":"/audio/ff3d22622fd1cccc3625.mp3"}},{"text":"거라","meaning":"表示某人的所有物。","explanation":"거：表示某人的所有物；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；라：连接名词判断、引用内容或相应的后续表达。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"3","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거라","audio":"/audio/3dba2bc87596c1512b18.mp3"}},{"text":"가격은","meaning":"价格，价钱","explanation":"가격：价格，价钱；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"가격","audio":"/audio/38c1b40757a204e578e9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62450","senseId":"1","lemma":"가격","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가격은","audio":"/audio/baf2a31a2da8f581084b.mp3"}},{"text":"비싸지만","meaning":"贵","explanation":"비싸다：贵；지만：表示转折或让步：“但是、虽然”。","readings":[{"term":"비싸다","audio":"/audio/063c1a7bb93233dcd205.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66318","senseId":"1","lemma":"비싸다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비싸지만","audio":"/audio/8c78e24e9d0f4285a7d9.mp3"}},{"text":"예뻐서","meaning":"漂亮，好看","explanation":"예쁘다：漂亮，好看；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"예쁘다","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89697","senseId":"1","lemma":"예쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"예뻐서","audio":"/audio/fed0c6a7d59a120ed2c6.mp3"}},{"text":"샀어.","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"샀어","audio":"/audio/99447433ba1c04adef5e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ded2b4943e89f57d","term":"고맙다","zh":"感谢，感激","audio":"/audio/ded2b4943e89f57dd33d.mp3","entryId":"20041","definition":"因别人为自己做了什么，内心感到很满足，并想给予回报。","pronunciation":["고ː맙따"]},{"id":"48e272a5efe4414e","term":"실크","zh":"丝绸，蚕丝","audio":"/audio/48e272a5efe4414e7afb.mp3","entryId":"66213","definition":"绢丝，或指用绢丝织成的布。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"3c159cf2a6420ca9","term":"만들다","zh":"制作，做，制造","audio":"/audio/3c159cf2a6420ca9bda5.mp3","entryId":"60317","definition":"使用气力或技术而使没有的东西生成。","pronunciation":["만들다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示某人的所有物。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示某人的所有物。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"38c1b40757a204e5","term":"가격","zh":"价格，价钱","audio":"/audio/38c1b40757a204e578e9.mp3","entryId":"62450","definition":"用钱表示的物品的价值。","pronunciation":["가격"]},{"id":"063c1a7bb93233dc","term":"비싸다","zh":"贵","audio":"/audio/063c1a7bb93233dcd205.mp3","entryId":"66318","definition":"物品的价格或做某事所花的费用高于一般水平。","pronunciation":["비싸다"]},{"id":"f62ff8982d788e72","term":"예쁘다","zh":"漂亮，好看","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3","entryId":"89697","definition":"长相看起来美丽，让人喜欢。","pronunciation":["예ː쁘다"]},{"id":"ee0ee072926e06fc","term":"사다","zh":"买，购买","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3","entryId":"49419","definition":"用钱使某种东西或权利为己所有。","pronunciation":["사다"]}],"audio":"/audio/cbf3a14688a9631c0d7e.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.9,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=66213","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":139,"sequenceScore":2.7267,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["谢谢。这是用丝绸做的，虽然价格有点贵，但因为它很漂亮所以就买了。","智秀，你的衬衫真漂亮啊。","敏洙，参加完修学旅行感觉怎么样？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["智秀，你的衬衫真漂亮啊。","敏洙，参加完修学旅行感觉怎么样？","谢谢。这是用丝绸做的，虽然价格有点贵，但因为它很漂亮所以就买了。"],"answer":2}]}
